{
  "recommendation": "The strongest documented sign-up bonus is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points, worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking-account credit.",
  "requirements": {
    "spending": "$5,000 in eligible purchases",
    "time_limit": "Within the first month after account opening",
    "eligibility": "New customers; account must remain open and in good standing"
  },
  "important_caveat": "The documented promotion is listed as running from August 1, 2025 through December 15, 2025. I cannot confirm from the available information that it is currently active, so please verify the offer shown in the application portal before applying.",
  "other_option": "If you prioritize ongoing cash back rather than the sign-up bonus, the Gold Rewards Card earns 2.5% on all purchases, but it requires a Rho-Bank+ subscription and a minimum credit score of 720. No separate sign-up bonus is documented for it.",
  "cost_note": "The EcoCard has a $50 annual fee and a 19.99% APR on carried balances, so the bonus may not be worthwhile if you expect to carry a balance.",
  "next_step": "If you tell me your expected monthly spending, whether you prefer points or straightforward cash back, and whether you already have Rho-Bank+, I can help compare the fit more precisely."
